@startuml

[*] --> Registered

state Registered
state Active
state FeeOverdue
state Suspended
state Graduated
state Archived

Registered --> Active : Student Enrolled

Active --> FeeOverdue : Fees Unpaid

FeeOverdue --> Active : Fees Settled

Active --> Suspended : Disciplinary Action

Suspended --> Active : Reinstated

Active --> Graduated : Completed Primary School

Graduated --> Archived : Student Record Archived

Archived --> [*]

@enduml